</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:03.000" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.520" end="00:00:24.520" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.040" end="00:00:42.040" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.040" end="00:00:42.040" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.200" end="00:00:50.200" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.119" end="00:01:10.119" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.119" end="00:01:40.759" style="s2">Alex, I&#39;m trapped.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.880" end="00:01:54.119" style="s2">She&#39;s in Midtown. 40 blocks of that.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.360" end="00:02:02.920" style="s2">I&#39;m coming. Carly.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.920" end="00:02:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carly.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.840" end="00:02:11.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. Where are you? Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.239" end="00:02:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trapped. Floor 40. Alex, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.680" end="00:02:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla,</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.959" end="00:02:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla, come on. Come on. No signal.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.560" end="00:02:32.720" style="s2">Every tower is down. She said trapped.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.920" end="00:02:38.120" style="s2">50th floor. That&#39;s 40 blocks from here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.720" end="00:02:38.120" style="s2">Water, light, bandages. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.040" end="00:02:44.760" style="s2">I&#39;m coming for you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.760" end="00:02:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help. Can anyone hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.840" end="00:03:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.760" end="00:03:04.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay. Think.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.680" end="00:03:04.680" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.800" end="00:03:14.400" style="s2">I&#39;m out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.720" end="00:03:17.400" style="s2">I&#39;m out now. Get up. You get up right</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.400" end="00:03:17.400" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.120" end="00:03:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. My leg. I can&#39;t push it off.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.080" end="00:03:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see you. Hold on. Every second I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.640" end="00:03:31.080" style="s2">here. Carly&#39;s running out of time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.200" end="00:03:40.239" style="s2">Can you walk?</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.159" end="00:03:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll manage. Go. Whoever you&#39;re trying</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.239" end="00:03:42.720" style="s2">to reach, go now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.200" end="00:03:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay against the inside wall. Don&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.720" end="00:03:46.920" style="s2">the elevator shaft side.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.920" end="00:03:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.080" end="00:04:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE. That&#39;s light. That&#39;s a way out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.360" end="00:04:02.599" style="s2">Don&#39;t stop. Whatever you do, don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.920" end="00:04:11.159" style="s2">Oh god.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.439" end="00:04:15.400" style="s2">40 blocks through that.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.520" end="00:04:29.840" style="s2">40 blocks. Just 40 blocks. Carla, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.960" end="00:04:31.759" style="s2">coming. Just hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.840" end="00:04:32.160" style="s2">Hey. Hey, Midtown. Which way is clear to</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.759" end="00:04:33.520" style="s2">Midtown?</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.160" end="00:04:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T TOUCH ME. IT&#39;S ALL GONE.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.520" end="00:04:35.759" style="s2">EVERYTHING&#39;S GONE.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.320" end="00:04:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PLEASE. MY GIRLFRIEND IS IN A BUILDING</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.759" end="00:04:40.960" style="s2">ON 48TH. Is the avenue open?</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.960" end="00:04:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you hear me? Which roads are still</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.960" end="00:04:43.680" style="s2">passable? North.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.000" end="00:04:46.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing left up there, man.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.680" end="00:04:46.680" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.800" end="00:04:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. My leg. I can&#39;t feel my leg.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.759" end="00:04:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see you. I&#39;m right here. What&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.120" end="00:04:55.600" style="s2">name?</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.440" end="00:04:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dana. It&#39;s Dana. Is he Is he dead?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.600" end="00:05:01.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s breathing. Dana, look at me. Just</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.520" end="00:05:01.280" style="s2">at me. I&#39;m not leaving you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.680" end="00:05:04.720" style="s2">bite down on this. It&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.960" end="00:05:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you just go? You could have made</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.720" end="00:05:06.800" style="s2">it out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.280" end="00:05:09.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because nobody&#39;s dying on this floor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.800" end="00:05:09.960" style="s2">Not today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.080" end="00:05:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We find another way out together.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.039" end="00:05:21.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 48th and Lex, have you come from up</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.560" end="00:05:23.120" style="s2">there? Is it passable?</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.360" end="00:05:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lex is blocked past 40th. Try the park</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.120" end="00:05:29.680" style="s2">side. Might still be open. Park side.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.600" end="00:05:31.280" style="s2">Okay. Okay, I can do that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.680" end="00:05:34.520" style="s2">GO.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.280" end="00:05:34.520" style="s2">NOT AGAIN.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.320" end="00:05:40.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off the street. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.960" end="00:05:45.160" style="s2">Oh god, it&#39;s coming down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.600" end="00:05:50.600" style="s2">Run,</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.720" end="00:05:58.880" style="s2">Carla. I&#39;m not dying here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.960" end="00:06:11.199" style="s2">I can&#39;t see.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.720" end="00:06:15.160" style="s2">I can&#39;t see anything. I&#39;m coming, Carly.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.199" end="00:06:15.160" style="s2">I don&#39;t care what&#39;s in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.160" end="00:06:30.759" style="s2">Still here. Keep moving. Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.880" end="00:06:42.840" style="s2">Come on. There has to be a window.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.160" end="00:06:42.840" style="s2">Window. Sky signal.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.440" end="00:06:52.680" style="s2">Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.759" end="00:06:57.120" style="s2">Alex, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.520" end="00:07:04.759" style="s2">see it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.840" end="00:07:09.479" style="s2">Somebody see it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.520" end="00:07:17.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; East. KEEP EAST. THIS WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.680" end="00:07:21.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T STOP. KEEP MOVING. Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.199" end="00:07:21.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are the buses? They said east 34.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.440" end="00:07:36.919" style="s2">Four miles.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.080" end="00:07:36.919" style="s2">Meridian Tower. She&#39;s there.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.039" end="00:07:43.000" style="s2">One block at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.199" end="00:07:49.000" style="s2">Just keep moving, Carol.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.400" end="00:07:57.240" style="s2">Get back. Get back. No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.599" end="00:08:09.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t move my leg. Please, please</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.759" end="00:08:12.720" style="s2">don&#39;t leave me here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.039" end="00:08:14.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming. Hold on. I&#39;m coming to you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.720" end="00:08:18.319" style="s2">The helicopter, it&#39;s gone. We have to</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.879" end="00:08:20.879" style="s2">get to the stairs now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.319" end="00:08:21.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; East. Keep moving east toward the river.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.879" end="00:08:24.400" style="s2">DO NOT STOP.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.680" end="00:08:25.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I NEED TO GO WEST. MIDTOWN is 7th Avenue</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.400" end="00:08:27.759" style="s2">passible.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.120" end="00:08:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WEST IS GONE, BUDDY. FIRES from 34th to</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.759" end="00:08:32.880" style="s2">50th. You&#39;ll die.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.440" end="00:08:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife is in there.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.880" end="00:08:35.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. He&#39;s still breathing. I CAN&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.640" end="00:08:37.760" style="s2">LIFT IT ALONE.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.919" end="00:08:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On three. Pull him the second it moves.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.760" end="00:08:40.760" style="s2">READY?</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.039" end="00:08:44.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep pressure on that leg. Get him east.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.560" end="00:08:48.519" style="s2">There are firefighters two blocks back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.560" end="00:08:48.519" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I can&#39;t stay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.120" end="00:08:53.760" style="s2">Leave me on this landing. Come back with</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.560" end="00:08:55.040" style="s2">help. You&#39;ll be faster alone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.760" end="00:08:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This building is burning from the top.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.040" end="00:08:56.959" style="s2">There is no coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.240" end="00:08:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.959" end="00:09:00.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t jump. I&#39;ll lower you. Grab the</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.800" end="00:09:04.519" style="s2">rebar on the other side and swing your</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.080" end="00:09:04.519" style="s2">good leg onto the landing. I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.920" end="00:09:10.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, it&#39;s me. I&#39;m in the stairwell,</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.320" end="00:09:10.959" style="s2">Meridian Tower. If you come here and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.080" end="00:09:12.800" style="s2">gone, I&#39;m trying to get down. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.959" end="00:09:13.839" style="s2">heading for the ground floor. I love</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.800" end="00:09:16.320" style="s2">you. Please find me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.839" end="00:09:19.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll come. If he&#39;s anything like you,</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.320" end="00:09:19.640" style="s2">he&#39;ll come.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.240" end="00:09:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Come on. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.080" end="00:09:33.480" style="s2">3.1 miles. I can do 3 miles. Hold on,</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.440" end="00:09:33.480" style="s2">Carla. I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.120" end="00:09:40.279" style="s2">2.6. Getting close. Getting close.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.519" end="00:09:49.480" style="s2">What the hell is that sound?</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.680" end="00:09:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.200" end="00:10:01.959" style="s2">There has to be another way. There has</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.880" end="00:10:01.959" style="s2">to be.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.360" end="00:10:18.800" style="s2">No, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.680" end="00:10:22.519" style="s2">There is no way through. Left blocked.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.800" end="00:10:22.519" style="s2">Right block.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.360" end="00:10:30.440" style="s2">Three in line running north under the</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.120" end="00:10:30.440" style="s2">fire. Subway half a block east.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.000" end="00:10:41.800" style="s2">Still on. Good. Underground, flooded,</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.839" end="00:10:41.800" style="s2">dark. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.000" end="00:10:48.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can feel it through the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.120" end="00:10:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eyes on me, not the ceiling.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.560" end="00:10:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the crack getting worse?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.040" end="00:10:56.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It stopped. We keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.720" end="00:10:56.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many floors left?</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.640" end="00:11:03.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.240" end="00:11:05.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Been here since the first shake.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.519" end="00:11:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m getting you out. Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.040" end="00:11:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frame&#39;s bucked. It won&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.440" end="00:11:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla, there has to be another way out.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.040" end="00:11:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Service corridor, floor 9, west side.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.480" end="00:11:18.000" style="s2">Doors marked. Maintenance.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.640" end="00:11:22.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming back for you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.000" end="00:11:22.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just get out. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.519" end="00:11:32.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello. Anyone down here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.240" end="00:11:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six blocks. Just six blocks. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.959" end="00:11:35.600" style="s2">moving.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.680" end="00:11:41.880" style="s2">Six blocks to the other side.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.120" end="00:11:50.440" style="s2">What is that? Is that the building?</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.240" end="00:12:12.279" style="s2">Come on. Come on. Come on. Up. Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.760" end="00:12:19.399" style="s2">Someone&#39;s down there.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.800" end="00:12:29.560" style="s2">200 ft. Just 200 ft.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.079" end="00:12:29.560" style="s2">Don&#39;t look back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.680" end="00:12:33.000" style="s2">Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.760" end="00:12:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you hear me? I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.600" end="00:12:49.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE DOORS WON&#39;T OPEN. PLEASE GET US OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.320" end="00:12:49.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I SEE YOU. I&#39;m getting you out now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.079" end="00:12:56.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feel that</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.639" end="00:12:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; building settling or another one coming?</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.800" end="00:13:00.880" style="s2">The crack is getting longer.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.079" end="00:13:04.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eyes on me, not the ceiling. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.880" end="00:13:04.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Double time. Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.560" end="00:13:12.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On three. Push. When I pull.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.399" end="00:13:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two. Three. Four.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.240" end="00:13:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move. Go. Go. Keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.000" end="00:13:18.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s one more. An older man.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.440" end="00:13:23.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He goes next. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.079" end="00:13:23.399" style="s2">Go. I&#39;m right behind you. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.600" end="00:13:34.600" style="s2">Carla.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.600" end="00:13:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.279" end="00:13:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carla, can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.680" end="00:13:50.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. I&#39;m okay. Keep moving. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.720" end="00:13:50.120" style="s2">wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.040" end="00:13:54.040" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.800" end="00:14:02.680" style="s2">What did they do?</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.360" end="00:14:02.680" style="s2">Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.199" end="00:14:16.519" style="s2">3%.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.519" end="00:14:16.519" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.880" end="00:14:25.880" style="s2">Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.040" end="00:14:30.360" style="s2">too close.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.600" end="00:14:44.920" style="s2">Stop shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.120" end="00:14:50.639" style="s2">Come on. Work.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.399" end="00:14:54.240" style="s2">Evacuate south if possible. Avoid</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.639" end="00:14:59.399" style="s2">bridges. After strokes expected</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.240" end="00:14:59.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; service stairwell, two doors east.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.240" end="00:15:03.639" style="s2">That&#39;s the route.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.639" end="00:15:14.680" style="s2">One bear. Hold.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.839" end="00:15:22.720" style="s2">Alex, pick up. Alex, I&#39;m trying to get</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.160" end="00:15:23.760" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.720" end="00:15:27.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carly, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.760" end="00:15:27.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in the service.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.480" end="00:15:32.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla. Carla.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.040" end="00:15:44.600" style="s2">Heard me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.079" end="00:15:49.079" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.360" end="00:15:55.639" style="s2">Stairwell right there.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.440" end="00:16:00.440" style="s2">No,</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.440" end="00:16:04.839" style="s2">no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.120" end="00:16:11.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.519" end="00:16:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That building, third floor. My wife is</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.160" end="00:16:16.240" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.720" end="00:16:20.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zone sealed, sir. Step back.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.240" end="00:16:20.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She called me. She&#39;s waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.519" end="00:16:26.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That zone is coming down. Nobody goes</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.680" end="00:16:28.720" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.240" end="00:16:31.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife is in there. Third floor.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.720" end="00:16:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody goes in.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.519" end="00:16:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll find another way.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.920" end="00:16:41.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.920" end="00:16:48.360" style="s2">4%. Keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.199" end="00:16:57.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Service alley, two blocks east.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.440" end="00:16:57.399" style="s2">Carla, pick up</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.520" end="00:17:14.039" style="s2">1%. Of course,</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.640" end="00:17:19.319" style="s2">air moves right. Go right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.720" end="00:17:29.799" style="s2">almost through. Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.480" end="00:17:29.799" style="s2">That&#39;s new.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.000" end="00:17:50.640" style="s2">Ground floor right there. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.360" end="00:18:03.559" style="s2">20 ft. Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.400" end="00:18:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s there? Don&#39;t move. Ceiling&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.480" end="00:18:20.480" style="s2">cracked.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.000" end="00:18:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a threat. The alley just collapsed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.480" end="00:18:23.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Midtown&#39;s gone. Three towers leaning.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.720" end="00:18:25.200" style="s2">One gust drops them.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.840" end="00:18:26.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have someone up there. What streets</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.200" end="00:18:28.240" style="s2">are still passable? You&#39;ll be crushed</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.559" end="00:18:33.000" style="s2">before you hit 45th Street.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.240" end="00:18:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None. That&#39;s why we&#39;re all down here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.000" end="00:18:38.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hell&#39;s Kitchen side streets avoids the</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.480" end="00:18:39.760" style="s2">high-rise corridor entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.240" end="00:18:40.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half that grit is rubble. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.760" end="00:18:43.360" style="s2">guessing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.799" end="00:18:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name is Carla. She&#39;s in Midtown. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.360" end="00:18:49.960" style="s2">going</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.720" end="00:18:49.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; take the water. East Wing has some left.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.080" end="00:19:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Down. Just find down. Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.640" end="00:19:04.280" style="s2">Don&#39;t come down yet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.000" end="00:19:10.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you fell. How long have you</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.679" end="00:19:13.360" style="s2">been here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.400" end="00:19:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An hour, maybe more. Lobby&#39;s one floor</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.360" end="00:19:20.200" style="s2">down. One floor. We can do one floor.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.600" end="00:19:20.200" style="s2">There&#39;s smoke. I smelled it earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.799" end="00:19:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If a woman named Carla comes through,</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.039" end="00:19:28.559" style="s2">tell her Alex went north on 9th.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.799" end="00:19:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s she going to know to look for you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.559" end="00:19:34.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She will.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.799" end="00:19:34.520" style="s2">God help you both.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.520" end="00:19:42.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I smell gasoline.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.080" end="00:19:43.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.080" end="00:19:48.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla,</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.600" end="00:19:48.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; eyes on me. One more flight.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.880" end="00:20:00.120" style="s2">No. Is there another way out?</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.640" end="00:20:04.280" style="s2">There has to be.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.919" end="00:20:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back away from it. The heat&#39;s getting</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.760" end="00:20:12.559" style="s2">worse.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.480" end="00:20:13.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing else. Every corridor</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.559" end="00:20:14.640" style="s2">ends here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.280" end="00:20:15.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ceiling&#39;s going to go. OH, WE NEED</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.640" end="00:20:16.880" style="s2">OUT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.360" end="00:20:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN WE FIND THE WAY OUT. WE HAVE NOT</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.880" end="00:20:20.440" style="s2">checked every wall.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.320" end="00:20:24.160" style="s2">If</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.480" end="00:20:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we go back up, the fire ISN&#39;T ABOVE US</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.160" end="00:20:25.919" style="s2">YET.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.400" end="00:20:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stair hole&#39;s full of smoke. You go</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.919" end="00:20:29.120" style="s2">up, you don&#39;t come back down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.200" end="00:20:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to burn in here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.120" end="00:20:35.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody is burning. Stay low. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.080" end="00:20:35.080" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.440" end="00:20:42.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those aren&#39;t yours. Nobody&#39;s coming back</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.360" end="00:20:44.320" style="s2">for them. Keep walking. People are</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.799" end="00:20:44.960" style="s2">bleeding three blocks from here. Put the</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.320" end="00:20:46.880" style="s2">bag down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.960" end="00:20:50.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last warning. You don&#39;t want to do this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.880" end="00:20:50.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither do you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.720" end="00:21:01.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to die for bandages?</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.679" end="00:21:05.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve walked through worse than you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.360" end="00:21:05.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then bleed for it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.360" end="00:21:20.200" style="s2">Go run, son of a.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.480" end="00:21:20.200" style="s2">She&#39;s still in there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.559" end="00:21:29.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delivery entrance, rear of the building.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.320" end="00:21:31.039" style="s2">How do you know it&#39;s not blocked, too?</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.679" end="00:21:31.440" style="s2">Feel that air? Something&#39;s open on the</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.039" end="00:21:35.240" style="s2">other end.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.440" end="00:21:35.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough for me. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.640" end="00:21:45.039" style="s2">I see light, Carla. I see light.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.960" end="00:21:45.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost there. Keep moving, EVERYONE.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.039" end="00:21:49.720" style="s2">KEEP MOVING.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.840" end="00:21:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE&#39;RE GOING TO MAKE IT.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.000" end="00:22:03.080" style="s2">NO,</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.080" end="00:22:03.080" style="s2">CARLA.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.080" end="00:22:16.559" style="s2">Oh god,</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.080" end="00:22:20.039" style="s2">the whole street.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.559" end="00:22:20.039" style="s2">It&#39;s all gone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.880" end="00:22:34.440" style="s2">There&#39;s no crossing this. Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.799" end="00:22:34.440" style="s2">Go back in. Find another way. injured</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.679" end="00:22:39.760" style="s2">only. You injured?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.280" end="00:22:43.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife. She was in a building on 43rd.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.760" end="00:22:43.799" style="s2">Everyone out here has someone inside.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.320" end="00:22:48.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me ask inside.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.320" end="00:22:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The 43rd Street collapsed. Did survivors</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.320" end="00:22:57.760" style="s2">come here? Dozens of buildings. Ask the</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.000" end="00:23:01.159" style="s2">intake desk. Where&#39;s intake? It&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.760" end="00:23:01.159" style="s2">Find a nurse.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.919" end="00:23:05.280" style="s2">Alex, her name is Carla, 43rd Street.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.559" end="00:23:06.320" style="s2">Have you seen her?</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.280" end="00:23:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t help you right now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.320" end="00:23:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, 2 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.080" end="00:23:14.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t seen her. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.679" end="00:23:14.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where? What am I calling here?</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.000" end="00:23:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla, 43rd Street collapsed. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.480" end="00:23:23.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That building. Emergency crews were sent</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.640" end="00:23:24.880" style="s2">there before the second quake.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.120" end="00:23:28.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sent there. You&#39;re sure?</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.880" end="00:23:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure. They got a crew in.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.240" end="00:23:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She might be alive.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.080" end="00:23:35.679" style="s2">Where are they staging survivors from</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.520" end="00:23:38.159" style="s2">that building?</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.679" end="00:23:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; East corridor basement triage. Follow</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.159" end="00:23:42.480" style="s2">the blue line.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.000" end="00:23:45.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blue line. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.480" end="00:23:45.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are the lights</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.159" end="00:24:00.679" style="s2">generator&#39;s gone? Everyone out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.760" end="00:24:09.120" style="s2">Stay low. The whole basement is on fire.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.120" end="00:24:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rescue crews. Which way to the east</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.120" end="00:24:11.840" style="s2">wing?</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.679" end="00:24:16.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget east. That stair hole&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.840" end="00:24:16.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE ARE PEOPLE TRAPPED down there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.520" end="00:24:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got you. ARMS AROUND MY NECK. DON&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.679" end="00:24:23.120" style="s2">LET GO.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.320" end="00:24:25.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I CAN&#39;T SEE. I can&#39;t see anything.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.120" end="00:24:25.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your eyes closed. I can see for</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.039" end="00:24:30.440" style="s2">both of us</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.679" end="00:24:30.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in here through the supply room now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.760" end="00:24:36.640" style="s2">her building. 38TH STREET TOWER. WHERE</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.840" end="00:24:38.080" style="s2">ARE THE SURVIVORS?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.640" end="00:24:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OFF ME. I HAVE CRITICAL PATIENTS</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.080" end="00:24:41.120" style="s2">CODING RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.960" end="00:24:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ONE ANSWER. That&#39;s all I need and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.120" end="00:24:42.799" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.440" end="00:24:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DON&#39;T KNOW EVERY PATIENT IN THIS</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.799" end="00:24:48.880" style="s2">HOSPITAL. 38th Street. That whole block</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.120" end="00:24:50.559" style="s2">panicked in the second quake.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.880" end="00:24:52.720" style="s2">Collapsed tower survivors are being</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.559" end="00:24:56.000" style="s2">tried near Brian Park, three blocks</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.720" end="00:24:56.400" style="s2">north. I know. Is she Brian Park? You</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.000" end="00:24:57.840" style="s2">sure?</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.400" end="00:25:01.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go now. Oh, THE FIRES ARE CUTTING OFF</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.840" end="00:25:01.080" style="s2">THE AVENUE.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.159" end="00:25:07.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CARLA, your hands, they&#39;re bleeding</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.840" end="00:25:09.679" style="s2">again. Good. Means I can still feel</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.679" end="00:25:11.440" style="s2">them. What&#39;s the plan? Front&#39;s blocked.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.679" end="00:25:12.720" style="s2">Back&#39;s a sinkhole. Side corridor past</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.440" end="00:25:15.960" style="s2">the loading dock. It was boarded down,</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.720" end="00:25:15.960" style="s2">not collapsed.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.960" end="00:25:23.760" style="s2">Come on. Come on. Load bearing wall. You</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.320" end="00:25:25.760" style="s2">can bring the whole ceiling down. Move</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.760" end="00:25:28.159" style="s2">him back from the doorway, Carla. Then</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.760" end="00:25:30.799" style="s2">it comes down. I am not dying in a</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.159" end="00:25:32.000" style="s2">lobby.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.799" end="00:25:33.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll bleed out before you break</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.000" end="00:25:35.200" style="s2">through. We should wait for rescue.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.360" end="00:25:35.840" style="s2">Rescue isn&#39;t coming down here, Nora. Not</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.200" end="00:25:38.799" style="s2">in time.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.840" end="00:25:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know that. Alex is coming. I</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.799" end="00:25:42.159" style="s2">need to meet him halfway. How do you</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.480" end="00:25:45.320" style="s2">know he&#39;s coming? Because I&#39;d be coming</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.159" end="00:25:45.320" style="s2">for him.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.440" end="00:26:00.919" style="s2">Nora,</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.080" end="00:26:00.919" style="s2">I see it halfway there.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.480" end="00:26:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see the sky.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.760" end="00:26:08.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not out. Those walls are six</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.840" end="00:26:09.600" style="s2">stories of rubble.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.720" end="00:26:13.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we&#39;re outside.</p>
