<p begin="01:00:17.599" end="01:00:20.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DOWN. GET DOWN.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.200" end="01:00:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEX, ARE YOU</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.160" end="01:00:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M FINE. GO.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.200" end="01:00:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FRONT OF THAT BUILDING IS GONE.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.880" end="01:00:28.480" style="s2">Schoolhouse now.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.640" end="01:00:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Count heads as you come in. How many?</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.480" end="01:00:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 14 from the waterfront. Anyone with</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.480" end="01:00:34.079" style="s2">medical training, step up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.240" end="01:00:35.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down. You&#39;re favoring your left</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.079" end="01:00:39.079" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.520" end="01:00:39.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help with the people.</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.839" end="01:00:44.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water first, then wounds. Anyone who can</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.720" end="01:00:46.559" style="s2">walk helps the ones who can&#39;t. We&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.559" end="01:00:49.119" style="s2">crackers. Not much, but it&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.559" end="01:00:51.040" style="s2">Pass them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.119" end="01:00:54.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should eat something</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.040" end="01:00:54.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.400" end="01:01:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This will sting once. Just once. Then</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.640" end="01:01:02.640" style="s2">it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.040" end="01:01:04.319" style="s2">Is my mom coming?</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.640" end="01:01:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone is looking. That&#39;s what they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.319" end="01:01:09.960" style="s2">all doing right now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.280" end="01:01:09.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t stop no matter what.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.839" end="01:01:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex,</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.480" end="01:01:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carly,</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.960" end="01:01:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.200" end="01:01:30.400" style="s2">God,</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.599" end="01:01:32.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.400" end="01:01:36.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tell me it&#39;s not bad.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.559" end="01:01:39.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t want you to.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.160" end="01:01:39.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex,</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.119" end="01:01:49.200" style="s2">how long</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.599" end="01:01:54.119" style="s2">since the bridge?</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.200" end="01:01:54.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora. Alex, how long?</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.880" end="01:02:03.280" style="s2">since the bridge.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.920" end="01:02:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.280" end="01:02:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.520" end="01:02:10.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.000" end="01:02:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You walked 12 blocks bleeding through</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.400" end="01:02:12.720" style="s2">your ribs.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.040" end="01:02:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t slowing anybody down.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.720" end="01:02:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not the point.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.680" end="01:02:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I needed to keep</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.720" end="01:02:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you tell me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.040" end="01:02:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You would have stopped.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.040" end="01:02:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.640" end="01:02:24.200" style="s2">I would have stopped.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.599" end="01:02:31.440" style="s2">Stopping isn&#39;t dying, Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.000" end="01:02:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was afraid if I stopped, I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.440" end="01:02:34.960" style="s2">start again.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.240" end="01:02:39.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You thought you&#39;d just stop?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.960" end="01:02:39.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I&#39;d lose you a second time.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.319" end="01:02:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cloth&#39;s bonded to it. This hurts before</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.079" end="01:02:45.520" style="s2">it gets better.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.880" end="01:02:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.520" end="01:02:47.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not saying anything.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.720" end="01:02:50.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re thinking loud.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.599" end="01:02:53.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still, both of you. I&#39;m here. Just</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.559" end="01:02:53.880" style="s2">hold still.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.040" end="01:03:04.240" style="s2">Down. Stay low. Everyone down. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.079" end="01:03:05.040" style="s2">holding. The walls are holding.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.240" end="01:03:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.040" end="01:03:10.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have your wrist.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.480" end="01:03:12.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. In the flood, the subway, water</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.160" end="01:03:13.200" style="s2">was at my chin. I let go.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.319" end="01:03:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of what?</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.200" end="01:03:16.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pipe I was holding. 3 seconds. I</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.880" end="01:03:18.160" style="s2">just let go.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.079" end="01:03:19.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recorded a goodbye message the night</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.160" end="01:03:19.760" style="s2">before we found the bridge.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.200" end="01:03:23.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.760" end="01:03:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stopped believing you were coming.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.039" end="01:03:27.280" style="s2">FEMA relief corridor established.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.880" end="01:03:29.839" style="s2">Prospect Park, Brooklyn. All survivors,</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.280" end="01:03:30.720" style="s2">proceed to Prospect Park, 3 miles inland</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.839" end="01:03:33.200" style="s2">from the waterfront.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.720" end="01:03:34.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Might is actually walkable.</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.200" end="01:03:36.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 miles.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.319" end="01:03:38.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we go.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.319" end="01:03:41.160" style="s2">I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.160" end="01:03:41.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex,</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.480" end="01:03:48.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.440" end="01:03:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prospect Park Relief Corridor, 3 miles</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.559" end="01:03:53.760" style="s2">inland. Prospect Park. Prospect Park</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.880" end="01:03:55.280" style="s2">Relief Corridor 3 miles inland.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.760" end="01:03:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are not leaving without you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.280" end="01:03:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not asking you to leave me. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.720" end="01:03:58.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the same thing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.760" end="01:04:00.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.640" end="01:04:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Asking you to go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.240" end="01:04:05.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll follow when</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.000" end="01:04:05.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; when what, Alex?</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.480" end="01:04:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eight people who can walk. Every hour we</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.559" end="01:04:11.520" style="s2">wait, that corridor could close.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.000" end="01:04:12.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we carry you. We have eight people.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.520" end="01:04:13.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A stretcher slows the whole column.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.720" end="01:04:14.880" style="s2">Another aftershock mid room.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.760" end="01:04:15.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t use them as your reason. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.880" end="01:04:16.000" style="s2">not what this is,</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.520" end="01:04:17.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.000" end="01:04:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not protecting them by making</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.440" end="01:04:22.720" style="s2">yourself easier to leave behind. Okay,</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.640" end="01:04:24.480" style="s2">here&#39;s what&#39;s happening. Anyone who can</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.720" end="01:04:26.240" style="s2">carry stretcher rotation. Anyone who</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.480" end="01:04:27.520" style="s2">can&#39;t, middle of the column. Nora, keep</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.240" end="01:04:27.839" style="s2">moving. We figure out the rest while we</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.520" end="01:04:29.280" style="s2">walk.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.839" end="01:04:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lie on that stretcher and tell us</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.280" end="01:04:32.960" style="s2">where to go. That is your job.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.799" end="01:04:36.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.960" end="01:04:36.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.520" end="01:04:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hop. I&#39;ve done worse.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.119" end="01:04:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will not hop three miles.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.520" end="01:04:51.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heavier than he looks.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.880" end="01:04:51.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard that. They&#39;re not wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.960" end="01:05:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re having a single slayer.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.799" end="01:05:06.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Breezel Slide. I was woring them.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.880" end="01:05:06.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me when we&#39;re there.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.440" end="01:05:10.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.960" end="01:05:11.119" style="s2">Someone&#39;s in that building.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.400" end="01:05:12.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure?</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.119" end="01:05:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First floor left of the door frame.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.720" end="01:05:15.200" style="s2">Listen.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.200" end="01:05:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This panel first. Brace the limb above</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.200" end="01:05:17.280" style="s2">before you pull.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.680" end="01:05:21.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s moving. It&#39;s moving.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.280" end="01:05:21.880" style="s2">We&#39;ve got you. Keep talking to me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.760" end="01:05:27.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.799" end="01:05:29.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.440" end="01:05:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 miles. We walked it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.280" end="01:05:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear birds.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.480" end="01:05:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, sweetheart. Me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.799" end="01:05:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back. Everyone back FROM THE EDGE.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.799" end="01:05:44.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DO NOT JUMP AT CARLA.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.400" end="01:05:45.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELLO.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.319" end="01:05:46.720" style="s2">HELLO. HELLO.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.520" end="01:05:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got her,</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.720" end="01:05:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carla.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.160" end="01:05:53.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.359" end="01:05:56.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ledge won&#39;t hold two of you. One of</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.280" end="01:05:58.559" style="s2">me is all it needs.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.559" end="01:06:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk to her. Keep her talking to you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.559" end="01:06:03.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, look at me. What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.720" end="01:06:03.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.880" end="01:06:15.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, don&#39;t move your feet. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.599" end="01:06:18.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. She&#39;s got it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.760" end="01:06:18.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.039" end="01:06:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re squishing me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.319" end="01:06:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Means I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.200" end="01:06:27.839" style="s2">Oh, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.400" end="01:06:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two blocks south. Everyone move now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.839" end="01:06:32.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.520" end="01:06:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.400" end="01:06:37.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was a bodega on this block. Green</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.880" end="01:06:38.960" style="s2">awning. Best coffee on Dean Street.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.039" end="01:06:40.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me where you&#39;re going after this</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.960" end="01:06:43.680" style="s2">when you&#39;ve slept.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.559" end="01:06:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister&#39;s place. Queens. How&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.680" end="01:06:48.039" style="s2">hands?</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.240" end="01:06:48.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like I crossed a ledge,</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.680" end="01:06:53.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.400" end="01:06:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m walking in</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.359" end="01:06:55.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your leg.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.000" end="01:06:57.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I&#39;ll walk beside you. Don&#39;t catch</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.839" end="01:06:58.400" style="s2">me. Actually, yes. Catch me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.119" end="01:07:01.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody asked if he could walk three</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.400" end="01:07:01.720" style="s2">miles either.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.839" end="01:07:08.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that it? Is that the lights?</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.960" end="01:07:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.319" end="01:07:12.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to make it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.760" end="01:07:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.400" end="01:07:15.400" style="s2">BUILDING.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.440" end="01:07:25.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DOWN. EVERYONE DOWN.</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.559" end="01:07:27.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEX, I SEE IT.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.760" end="01:07:28.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHOULDER. GET THE SLAB off the shoulder.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.280" end="01:07:32.359" style="s2">Not the back.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.000" end="01:07:32.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex. Alex. I&#39;m right here. Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.319" end="01:07:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.520" end="01:07:39.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.839" end="01:07:42.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 ft.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.839" end="01:07:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex. ALEX, OPEN YOUR EYES. ALEX, MA&#39;AM,</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.960" end="01:07:47.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I NEED YOU TO MOVE.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.520" end="01:07:47.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JUST WE WALK. Let them work.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.880" end="01:07:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should sit down.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.559" end="01:07:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.280" end="01:07:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He walked out of that rubble. That</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.400" end="01:07:56.480" style="s2">counts for something.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.960" end="01:07:58.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t walk. They carried him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.480" end="01:08:01.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He made it here. So did you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.799" end="01:08:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s stable. Three, maybe four fractured</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.119" end="01:08:06.039" style="s2">ribs. Blood loss managed. He&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.480" end="01:08:06.039" style="s2">be in a lot of pain.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.480" end="01:08:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he&#39;s alive. He&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.240" end="01:08:13.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.000" end="01:08:13.559" style="s2">Can I see him?</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.440" end="01:08:23.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed me clear. You didn&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.600" end="01:08:24.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I did.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.120" end="01:08:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re an idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.960" end="01:08:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.920" end="01:08:31.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another group from Flatbrook.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.440" end="01:08:33.199" style="s2">Registration backlog is 3 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.440" end="01:08:33.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 hours. I need a table and someone who</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.199" end="01:08:34.640" style="s2">writes fast. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.839" end="01:08:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; still not on my roster.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.640" end="01:08:38.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Table writer. 2 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.480" end="01:08:41.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is she? She walked us here from</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.159" end="01:08:41.199" style="s2">Carol Street.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.440" end="01:08:52.080" style="s2">You carried this the whole time.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.279" end="01:08:53.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The whole time?</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.080" end="01:08:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From the beginning.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.359" end="01:08:56.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.560" end="01:08:58.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re hearing this, then I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.159" end="01:09:00.159" style="s2">make it out. Or you found the phone</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.080" end="01:09:01.920" style="s2">without me. I need you to know I tried.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.159" end="01:09:03.600" style="s2">I&#39;m still trying. The last thing I was</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.920" end="01:09:05.679" style="s2">thinking about was finding you. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.600" end="01:09:06.239" style="s2">look for me too long. Go somewhere safe.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.679" end="01:09:11.480" style="s2">Live.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.239" end="01:09:11.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know if you were alive. I know</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.759" end="01:09:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you don&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.279" end="01:09:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.839" end="01:09:26.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.400" end="01:09:26.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think I&#39;m going to be.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.759" end="01:09:34.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.440" end="01:09:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s blue.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.719" end="01:09:37.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, baby. I forgot what that looked</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.120" end="01:09:41.080" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.759" end="01:09:41.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.520" end="01:09:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to have to figure out what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.799" end="01:09:49.359" style="s2">next.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.839" end="01:09:51.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.359" end="01:09:54.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have any ideas?</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.199" end="01:09:54.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
